ty via dynamic ARIA labels and consolidated focus points.\n\nCo-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","messageHeadline":"palette: implement copyable forecast surface with robust error handling","oid":"4265d9c0dc663a8edc2dc82d62c12a8a8619e16c"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-10T04:31:56Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"DDD-Enterprises (DJ Daddy Dom & the Department of… Don’t ask, Don’t tell, Don’t stop, Don’t you dare…)"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-10T05:54:01Z","messageBody":"Move forecast copy onto a dedicated control so LinearProgress is not nested\nunder role=button; disable the control without a prediction; restore\naria-valuetext and decorative aria-hidden icons; wire TaskSequencer onError.","messageHeadline":"fix(ui): PredictionPanel a11y + TaskSequencer onError prop","oid":"edf2a94ded25f77cc997520f8f991bd8dd19ebe1"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-10T04:36:11Z","authors":[{"email":"167156098+hu3mann@users.noreply.github.com","id":"U_kgDOCfaZgg","login":"hu3mann","name":"hu3mann"},{"email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-10T05:54:01Z","messageBody":"- Moved copy interaction from root Paper to a dedicated 'Copyable Surface' in the insight box (TeamDashboard pattern).\n- Root Paper is now a focusable summary container (tabIndex={0}) without role=\"button\".\n- LinearProgress is now correctly exposed to assistive technology.\n- Updated Accessibility.test.tsx to verify the new interaction model.\n- Maintained robust timer management and error propagation.\n\nCo-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","messageHeadline":"palette: implement dedicated copy control for PredictionPanel","oid":"eb86291898b6baa6e4780021483021200923f7bf"},{"authoredDate":